// How long features usually last (KNOWLEDGE.md §8, CONTENT_LANGUAGE.md §17's
// recognition): a coat changes daily, the rest of how someone looks hardly
// at all. Recognition weighs a conflict on a short-lived feature lightly: it
// may be the same one, changed.
// Something said of a feature of how things look.
#OfFeature: { feature: text }

#Persistence: #OfFeature & { persists: time }

coat_persists: #Persistence & { feature: "coat", persists: 1d } @family(persistence)

// How a feature blurs with distance (KNOWLEDGE.md §5, perception's
// precision): `blur` steps for each tile beyond arm's reach.
#Acuity: #OfFeature & { blur: int }

size_blurs: #Acuity & { feature: "size", blur: 1 } @family(acuity)
